	(text "PVDD_TRIM: 2-pole RC 10k/1uF x2 (15.9 Hz) fitted; R907 68k + D901 DNP. Hi-Z or 0 V = 18 V, 3.3 V = 12.3 V; trim can only lower PVDD."
		(at 261.62 125.73 0)
		(effects
